judge-ceiling

This repository includes a derived extract of third-party material.

* consensus_panel.json -- the per-model verdict matrix from
  HumeAI/asr-benchmark-optimization, repro/data/consensus/
  vox_en_newwl4_{samples,aggregate}.json, Copyright 2026 Hume AI,
  licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  https://github.com/HumeAI/asr-benchmark-optimization

  Only the verdict matrix, the model list, the published scores and the
  scoring parameters are kept; the source transcripts are not reproduced.
  fetch_consensus.py regenerates the extract from the upstream files and
  fetch_consensus.py --check verifies it still matches them.

  Paper: Towards Quantifying Benchmark Optimization in ASR Models,
  arXiv:2608.19936.
